; Layers scroll with the camera at 25% / 55% / 100% (sideways and up / down). Each image is 1280 x (1 + scale) wide so
; it covers the camera's whole range across the 2560-wide stage, and 1080 tall (360 px above the screen).
; The background is two layers at the same 25%: the sky (wraps sideways, its clouds drift left) behind the pillars
; (the sky cut out). Built by stages/build_living_bg.py.

